lor:var(--color-primary)\">Dr. Marcus Vance</span></div><a style=\"font-size:0.85rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-secondary);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.3rem\" href=\"/blog/esg-carbon-intensity-reporting-for-enterprise-shippers\"><span>Read Article</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></div></section></div></main><footer class=\"Footer_footer__eNA9m\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"Footer_footerGrid__Zjk4v\"><div class=\"Footer_brandCol__6UIwg\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.75rem\"><div style=\"width:36px;height:36px;background-color:var(--color-accent);border-radius:var(--radius-sm);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#FFFFFF\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-truck\"><path d=\"M14 18V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v11a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h2\"></path><path d=\"M15 18H9\"></path><path d=\"M19 18h2a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-3.65a1 1 0 0 0-.22-.624l-3.48-4.35A1 1 0 0 0 17.52 8H14\"></path><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\"></circle><circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg></div><div><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading);font-size:1.2rem;font-weight:800;color:#FFFFFF;letter-spacing:-0.02em;display:block\">GETDIGIFORT</span><span style=\"font-size:0.65rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--color-accent);letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase\">DMB TRANSIT INC.</span></div></div><p class=\"Footer_brandDesc__JyP2_\">GetDigiFort (Owned and Operated by DMB Transit Inc.) is a premier North American asset-based carrier and supply chain solutions provider, operating over 450 Class-8 power units and specialized trailing assets.<!-- --> Asset-based transportation, GDP cold chain, and high-volume FTL freight solutions across North America.</p><div style=\"font-size:0.8125rem;color:#CBD5E1\"><strong>Operational Credentials:</strong> <!-- -->USDOT 3849120<!-- --> | <!-- -->MC-892104<!-- --> | SCAC: <!-- -->DMBT</div><div class=\"Footer_certList__YOlHk\"><span class=\"Footer_certBadge___gRrj\">ISO 9001:2015 Certified</span><span class=\"Footer_certBadge___gRrj\">EPA SmartWay Transport Partner</span><span class=\"Footer_certBadge___gRrj\">TIA Certified Transportation Broker</span><span class=\"Footer_certBadge___gRrj\">C-TPAT Tier 2 Validated Carrier</span><span class=\"Footer_certBadge___gRrj\">GDP Compliant Cold Chain Carrier</span></div></div><div><h4 class=\"Footer_colTitle__u3AX5\">Freight Services</h4><ul class=\"Footer_linkList__K_ONQ\"><li><a href=\"/services/full-truckload-ftl\">Full Truckload (FTL)</a></li><li><a href=\"/services/temperature-controlled-cold-chain\">Refrigerated Cold Chain</a></li><li><a href=\"/services/heavy-haul-specialized\">Heavy Haul &amp; Over-Dimensional</a></li><li><a href=\"/services/intermodal-rail-freight\">Intermodal Rail Freight</a></li><li><a href=\"/services/warehousing-contract-logistics\">Contract Warehousing</a></li><li><a href=\"/services/expedited-critical-freight\">Expedited &amp; Hot-Shot Freight</a></li></ul></div><div><h4 class=\"Footer_colTitle__u3AX5\">Company &amp; Insights</h4><ul class=\"Footer_linkList__K_ONQ\"><li><a href=\"/about\">About GetDigiFort</a></li><li><a href=\"/fleet\">Fleet Specifications</a></li><li><a href=\"/industries\">Industries Served</a></li><li><a href=\"/research\">Research &amp; Insights</a></li><li><a href=\"/blog\">Logistics Blog</a></li><li><a href=\"/contact\">Terminal Network</a></li></ul></div><div class=\"Footer_contactCol__dVXsM\"><h4 class=\"Footer_colTitle__u3AX5\">Dispatch Command</h4><div class=\"Footer_contactI